(7233220, 1119329, 138253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great place to watch the sun set with friends/family after a relaxing day<br/>/7</td>', 'Looks like a great place to watch the sun set with friends/family after a relaxing day/7', '2014-06-25 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233237, 1119422, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think it''s fantastic that you were able to capture the sun without actually including the sun in the image. The warm rays are beaming across everything, except that foreground rock. I will admit, that rock does bother me, but it did take me a second to notice it too.</td>', 'I think it''s fantastic that you were able to capture the sun without actually including the sun in the image. The warm rays are beaming across everything, except that foreground rock. I will admit, that rock does bother me, but it did take me a second to notice it too.', '2014-06-25 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233241, 1119379, 60173, '<td valign="top">The 800px limit really does this no justice. Beautiful scene, and I appreciate that you captured the colors of the sun creates and not just the sun itself. Someone once told me to not forget to turn around when watching a sun set or rise. Some of the best colors will be behind you.</td>', 'The 800px limit really does this no justice. Beautiful scene, and I appreciate that you captured the colors of the sun creates and not just the sun itself. Someone once told me to not forget to turn around when watching a sun set or rise. Some of the best colors will be behind you.', '2014-06-25 14:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233244, 1119407, 60173, '<td valign="top">Interesting and detailed silhouette. I really like all the cranes and different roof heights. And those windows on the bottom right are great too! I would be happy with just those interesting bits, but the sky was kind and gave you some crazy wispy-ness as a bonus. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting and detailed silhouette. I really like all the cranes and different roof heights. And those windows on the bottom right are great too! I would be happy with just those interesting bits, but the sky was kind and gave you some crazy wispy-ness as a bonus. Nice job.', '2014-06-25 14:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233254, 1119528, 60173, '<td valign="top">Oh noes! How dare ye cows burst from their frame! It''s a stampede, ahhh!<br/> <br/>Anywho, it''s a lovely scene that I would have preferred not be edited with a frame as such. For me it takes me out of the scene itself and just puts these perdy cows on a wall. The style isn''t for me, but it certainly has its place, I''m sure.</td>', 'Oh noes! How dare ye cows burst from their frame! It''s a stampede, ahhh! Anywho, it''s a lovely scene that I would have preferred not be edited with a frame as such. For me it takes me out of the scene itself and just puts these perdy cows on a wall. The style isn''t for me, but it certainly has its place, I''m sure.', '2014-06-25 14:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233257, 1119455, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The horizon needs to be straightened a tad though.</td>', 'Beautiful! The horizon needs to be straightened a tad though.', '2014-06-25 14:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233261, 1119585, 60173, '<td valign="top">This looks a overcooked. I think you may have pushed the saturation up too much. You''ve lost detail in some of the reds and the yellow.</td>', 'This looks a overcooked. I think you may have pushed the saturation up too much. You''ve lost detail in some of the reds and the yellow.', '2014-06-25 14:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233262, 1118868, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''ve had that feeling. At least pop the screen out.  :)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=950633" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1386/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_950633.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1386/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_950633.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1386/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_950633.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I''ve had that feeling. At least pop the screen out.  :) ', '2014-06-25 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233263, 1119623, 60173, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there''s enough evidence here that it was either a sun setting or rising. It''s a pleasant, simple image though.</td>', 'I don''t think there''s enough evidence here that it was either a sun setting or rising. It''s a pleasant, simple image though.', '2014-06-25 14:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233265, 1119611, 60173, '<td valign="top">OMG, nuclear explosion AND a bird diving! <br/> <br/>I''d love to see the original of this photo. It''s such a shame that the sun blew out as it did.</td>', 'OMG, nuclear explosion AND a bird diving!  I''d love to see the original of this photo. It''s such a shame that the sun blew out as it did.', '2014-06-25 15:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233266, 1118959, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love the "fire" on the water. That''s really interesting.</td>', 'I love the "fire" on the water. That''s really interesting.', '2014-06-25 15:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233267, 1119291, 60173, '<td valign="top">Lovely silhouette. That baby''s hair is craaaazy! heh</td>', 'Lovely silhouette. That baby''s hair is craaaazy! heh', '2014-06-25 15:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233268, 1119602, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line that carries the viewer out onto the jetty. There''s some great misty stuff going on with the foreground small rocks too.</td>', 'Nice leading line that carries the viewer out onto the jetty. There''s some great misty stuff going on with the foreground small rocks too.', '2014-06-25 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233288, 1118807, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing composition, but not hugely keen on the style of processing.</td>', 'A pleasing composition, but not hugely keen on the style of processing.', '2014-06-25 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233289, 1119378, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pleasingly subtle.</td>', 'Pleasingly subtle.', '2014-06-25 15:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233290, 1119561, 138253, '<td valign="top">this is almost surreal in it''s appearance. the silky waves and sand look more like a generated image i would expect to see at digital blasphemy.<br/>i can''t fault you on the technicals, and it is definitely more sunset than silhouette (which many entries are turning out to be)<br/>while i do expect the look of this to resonate strongly with voters, i''m also a little sad that i don''t like it as much as i think i may have in a lot of other challenges due to the heavy processing. <br/>i''m going to give this a 7 now to keep it higher in my list for a second look, and i reserve the right to change my mind based on how i feel after i finish voting 100% (this would normally be given a 9 or 10 by me but i''m jaded with this challenge line-up and the entries i''ve seen so far)</td>', 'this is almost surreal in it''s appearance. the silky waves and sand look more like a generated image i would expect to see at digital blasphemy.i can''t fault you on the technicals, and it is definitely more sunset than silhouette (which many entries are turning out to be)while i do expect the look of this to resonate strongly with voters, i''m also a little sad that i don''t like it as much as i think i may have in a lot of other challenges due to the heavy processing. i''m going to give this a 7 now to keep it higher in my list for a second look, and i reserve the right to change my mind based on how i feel after i finish voting 100% (this would normally be given a 9 or 10 by me but i''m jaded with this challenge line-up and the entries i''ve seen so far)', '2014-06-25 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233291, 1119422, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  A beautifully observed photograph.</td>', 'Lovely.  A beautifully observed photograph.', '2014-06-25 15:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233292, 1119528, 92577, '<td valign="top">Haha. Love the border - let''s go DPC!!! I think you may have been allowed to put a drop shadow under their feet as well but who t f knows?</td>', 'Haha. Love the border - let''s go DPC!!! I think you may have been allowed to put a drop shadow under their feet as well but who t f knows?', '2014-06-25 15:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233294, 1119585, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the processing at all.</td>', 'Not keen on the processing at all.', '2014-06-25 15:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233295, 1119580, 67258, '<td valign="top">Open, free, pleasantly subtle.</td>', 'Open, free, pleasantly subtle.', '2014-06-25 15:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
