(7233312, 1118928, 138253, '<td valign="top">i don''t mind the blurring on the clouds, that''s to be expected in a long exposure like this<br/>i am very glad to see that you didn''t silhouette the scenery here; and i love the cloud cover over the city. right now this image is in my top 2 favorite i''ve seen so far and i''m giving it an 8 as such.<br/>truly great image.</td>', 'i don''t mind the blurring on the clouds, that''s to be expected in a long exposure like thisi am very glad to see that you didn''t silhouette the scenery here; and i love the cloud cover over the city. right now this image is in my top 2 favorite i''ve seen so far and i''m giving it an 8 as such.truly great image.', '2014-06-25 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233314, 1118800, 138253, '<td valign="top">i love how calm the water is here, like a sheet of glass reflecting the sky.<br/>image is not overdone, and is not trying to be something it isn''t - it''s perfect how it is.<br/>thank you for giving me this image to relax my eyes on in this challenge.<br/>a 9 from me.</td>', 'i love how calm the water is here, like a sheet of glass reflecting the sky.image is not overdone, and is not trying to be something it isn''t - it''s perfect how it is.thank you for giving me this image to relax my eyes on in this challenge.a 9 from me.', '2014-06-25 15:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233316, 1119387, 138253, '<td valign="top">nice image, and it has a lot going for it in that you''re not trying to use this same shot to enter silhouettes, but as for the topic being sunrise/set, i find the sky is a little too dark in the composition. to quote a famous movie line "missed it by *that* much" for timing in the sky.<br/>i still think it''s a beautiful shot and i''m giving it a 6</td>', 'nice image, and it has a lot going for it in that you''re not trying to use this same shot to enter silhouettes, but as for the topic being sunrise/set, i find the sky is a little too dark in the composition. to quote a famous movie line "missed it by *that* much" for timing in the sky.i still think it''s a beautiful shot and i''m giving it a 6', '2014-06-25 16:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233317, 1119434, 138253, '<td valign="top">well composed and thank you for keeping the tree from being a silhouette<br/>looks like a great place for a little one to play, and the view of the hills and open sky is great.<br/>a 7 from me</td>', 'well composed and thank you for keeping the tree from being a silhouettelooks like a great place for a little one to play, and the view of the hills and open sky is great.a 7 from me', '2014-06-25 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233320, 1118959, 138253, '<td valign="top">lucky break in the clouds there to get that window for the sun. love the reflection of the light on the waves.<br/>a 6 from me.</td>', 'lucky break in the clouds there to get that window for the sun. love the reflection of the light on the waves.a 6 from me.', '2014-06-25 16:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233321, 1119313, 138253, '<td valign="top">i just want more from this picture. more light on that black bottom and more drama/color in the sky (naturally, not overcooked to get it there).<br/>i know we don''t all get ideal shots, and thank you for not trying to fake it, but it just doesn''t have the punch that i''d like to see to give it a high score.</td>', 'i just want more from this picture. more light on that black bottom and more drama/color in the sky (naturally, not overcooked to get it there).i know we don''t all get ideal shots, and thank you for not trying to fake it, but it just doesn''t have the punch that i''d like to see to give it a high score.', '2014-06-25 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233322, 1119527, 138253, '<td valign="top">overall i''m not impressed with the amount of silhouette front-line subjects in this challenge. if someone was to read all of my comments in this challenge they''d see a very strong trend and several copy/paste comments.<br/>i really like the sky you''re showing here, but the silhouetted barbed wire along with the black land at the bottom of the frame are very detracting in my opinion.<br/>5</td>', 'overall i''m not impressed with the amount of silhouette front-line subjects in this challenge. if someone was to read all of my comments in this challenge they''d see a very strong trend and several copy/paste comments.i really like the sky you''re showing here, but the silhouetted barbed wire along with the black land at the bottom of the frame are very detracting in my opinion.5', '2014-06-25 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233323, 1119412, 138253, '<td valign="top">thats a very interesting cloud you captured there... looks like the displacement of someone doing a belly flop, which has me smiling at the thought of belly flopping into a cloud to make it go all wonky like that.<br/>the pinkish/purple tones seem out of place to me, but overall the lighting feels very natural, so i''ll go with the fact that this is how it looked in person.<br/>thank you for still keeping your foreground exposed and not a black void.<br/>a 6 from me.</td>', 'thats a very interesting cloud you captured there... looks like the displacement of someone doing a belly flop, which has me smiling at the thought of belly flopping into a cloud to make it go all wonky like that.the pinkish/purple tones seem out of place to me, but overall the lighting feels very natural, so i''ll go with the fact that this is how it looked in person.thank you for still keeping your foreground exposed and not a black void.a 6 from me.', '2014-06-25 16:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7233325, 1119395, 138253, '<td valign="top">cannot vote due to tpl rules.<br/>i still like this image, and after going through so many silhouetted/overcooked entries this one is standing out to me as a seemingly strong contender for a good score. i hope i''m right.</td>', 'cannot vote due to tpl rules.i still like this image, and after going through so many silhouetted/overcooked entries this one is standing out to me as a seemingly strong contender for a good score. i hope i''m right.', '2014-06-25 16:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
