(7233331, 1119624, 138253, '<td valign="top">the cove, you say.<br/>as much as i want to love this image (purple being my favorite color and dramatic skies being one of the things i love seeing the most in pictures), this just feels very off to me. i do not recall ever witnessing a purple sunset before, so i''m having a hard job mentally not thinking of this as being over processed.<br/>the bottom 20% (roughly) of the image is also taking away from it in my opinion, and i can live with the silhouette in this as you have not made it a major component of the image.<br/> <br/>i actually google''d "purple sunset" and found a striking number of images...now you have given me something new to look for, i must experience one of these myself somewhere.<br/>and after all of that, i''m giving you an 8.</td>', 'the cove, you say.as much as i want to love this image (purple being my favorite color and dramatic skies being one of the things i love seeing the most in pictures), this just feels very off to me. i do not recall ever witnessing a purple sunset before, so i''m having a hard job mentally not thinking of this as being over processed.the bottom 20% (roughly) of the image is also taking away from it in my opinion, and i can live with the silhouette in this as you have not made it a major component of the image. i actually google''d "purple sunset" and found a striking number of images...now you have given me something new to look for, i must experience one of these myself somewhere.and after all of that, i''m giving you an 8.', '2014-06-25 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
