(7234017, 1119455, 156466, '<td valign="top">Straighten the horizon and crop down to a nice landscape format and you''ve got a winner.  Would sort of like to see where the bird meets the water.</td>', 'Straighten the horizon and crop down to a nice landscape format and you''ve got a winner.  Would sort of like to see where the bird meets the water.', '2014-06-27 15:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
