(7234031, 1118890, 156466, '<td valign="top">Seen this so many times before.  But I still have to give it an 8.  Nicely framed and processed.</td>', 'Seen this so many times before.  But I still have to give it an 8.  Nicely framed and processed.', '2014-06-27 15:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
