(7235224, 1119617, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like your different take on the challenge. You''ve got some nice reflective colors in the water which is nice, too.</td>', 'I like your different take on the challenge. You''ve got some nice reflective colors in the water which is nice, too.', '2014-07-01 19:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
