(7235249, 1118808, 58634, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing. The perspective is perfect. I mostly enjoy the leading lines created by the water waves. Very striking and beautiful.</td>', 'Mesmerizing. The perspective is perfect. I mostly enjoy the leading lines created by the water waves. Very striking and beautiful.', '2014-07-01 20:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
